gamllami wacchacunatapis cuyapanqui» nir.","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["Israelcuna allina goyänanpaj Tayta Dios aunishan"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["Tayta Diosmi nin:",{"text":"«Päsacäcushanami rabyashäpis.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mana wiyacoj cashanpita Israelcunataga allchacächishänami.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mana cuyaypäno caycaptinpis cuyashänami.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Israelcunapäga cashaj tamyariptin shullay quëdashanömi.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Paycunanami caycanga liryucuna waytajno.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Paycunaga canga Líbano jircacho yöracuna","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"sumaj sapichasha caycajnömi.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Olivo yörapa rämancuna carucama mashtarashannömi","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"paycunaga aypallaman miranga.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Líbano munticho sedru alli asyashannörämi cangapis.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Israel runacunaga yapaymi nogapa maquëcho goyanga.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Chayrämi canga rïgu shicshiraycajno.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Übas sumaj chillguiraycashannörämi canga.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Paycunapäga may-chaychöpis parlanga Líbano bïnupänörämi.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Acrashä runacunataga nogami ricä, chayno mañacamashantapis wiyä.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nogaga pïno yöra berdiraycajnömi caycä.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nogami achcaman mirananpäpis yanapä.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Chaymi Efraín runacunaga nengapaj: ‹¿Imapänataj munä cay ïdulucunata?› nir.»","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Yachaj cajcunaga, yarpaysapa cajcunaga cay willacuyta tantiyachun.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tayta Diospa caminunga derëchumi.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Alli runacunaga chaypami purin.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Juchasapacunami ichanga chay caminucho tacacan.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/qub_wbt/HOS/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/qub_wbt/JOL/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/qub_wbt/HOS/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}